### Secrets & Local Environment Overrides ###
# Never commit real credentials, API keys, or local secrets
*.env
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
application-local.yaml
application-local.properties
application-secrets.yaml

### Frontend — Root-level safety net ###
# The frontend/.gitignore covers these locally; root rules add a second line of defence
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/coverage/
frontend/.vite/
frontend/*.local

### Docker Local Overrides ###
# docker-compose.override.yml is used for local developer customisations (ports, volumes)
docker-compose.override.yml

